       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI55602.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI55602.
      *
      *     Detalhe de movimento
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI55602         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7201 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV5560.
       COPY SWCV5561.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.
      *
       COPY AQCW0005.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT7201 PIC X(08) VALUE 'SWVT7201'.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            VARIAVEIS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-VERIAVEIS.
           05 WS-MRHORA-X                  PIC  X(08) VALUE SPACES.
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-MRHORA-X.
              10 WS-HR                     PIC  9(02).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(01).
              10 WS-MN                     PIC  9(02).
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(01).
              10 WS-SG                     PIC  9(02).
           05 WS-MRHORA-N                  PIC  9(06) VALUE ZEROES.
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-MRHORA-N.
              10 WS-HRS                    PIC  9(02).
              10 WS-MNS                    PIC  9(02).
              10 WS-SGS                    PIC  9(02).
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME            PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI55602'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                        PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI55602         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
       COPY VIAL0004.
      *
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV5560-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5560-ASE       TO SWCV5561-ASE.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5560-ADE       TO SWCV5561-ADE.

ARREB *    CALL 'ARREB'

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2100-OBTEM-DADOS
                 THRU 2199-OBTEM-DADOS-EXIT
           END-IF

           .
       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-OBTEM-DADOS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-OBTEM-DADOS.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-OBTEM-DADOS' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5560-MRNOPR            TO SWCD7201-MRNOPR.
           MOVE SWCV5560-MRNORD            TO SWCD7201-MRNORD.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT
                     MRBALC
                   , MRCCB
                   , NCCCCBAN
                   , NCCCCSPAI
                   , NCCCCCONTA
                   , MRTDOC
                   , MRCOPE
                   , MRNDOC
                   , MRVLR
                   , MRSALD
                   , MRUSER
                   , MRDTSIS
                   , MRHORA
                   , MRDATL
                   , MRDRCX
                   , MRETRB
                   , MRBALM
                   , MROBS
                   , MRNOPR
                   , MRNOPS
                   , MRNORD
                   , MREANL
                   , MRDTCB
                   , MREXCT
                   , MRMOED
                   , MRDMOV
                   , GBMRINFC
                   , CCHAVE
                   , IRECONC
                   , CCODMSG
                   , DATVAL
                   , COSN
                   , COSNC
                   , CREF
                   , CREFOPR
                   , CTIPREC
                   , GOBS
                   , CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST
                INTO
                     :SWCD7201-MRBALC
                   , :SWCD7201-MRCCB
                   , :SWCD7201-NCCCCBAN
                   , :SWCD7201-NCCCCSPAI
                   , :SWCD7201-NCCCCCONTA
                   , :SWCD7201-MRTDOC
                   , :SWCD7201-MRCOPE
                   , :SWCD7201-MRNDOC
                   , :SWCD7201-MRVLR
                   , :SWCD7201-MRSALD
                   , :SWCD7201-MRUSER
                   , :SWCD7201-MRDTSIS
                   , :SWCD7201-MRHORA
                   , :SWCD7201-MRDATL
                   , :SWCD7201-MRDRCX
                   , :SWCD7201-MRETRB
                   , :SWCD7201-MRBALM
                   , :SWCD7201-MROBS
                   , :SWCD7201-MRNOPR
                   , :SWCD7201-MRNOPS
                   , :SWCD7201-MRNORD
                   , :SWCD7201-MREANL
                   , :SWCD7201-MRDTCB
                   , :SWCD7201-MREXCT
                   , :SWCD7201-MRMOED
                   , :SWCD7201-MRDMOV
                   , :SWCD7201-GBMRINFC
                   , :SWCD7201-CCHAVE
                   , :SWCD7201-IRECONC
                   , :SWCD7201-CCODMSG
                   , :SWCD7201-DATVAL
                   , :SWCD7201-COSN
                   , :SWCD7201-COSNC
                   , :SWCD7201-CREF
                   , :SWCD7201-CREFOPR
                   , :SWCD7201-CTIPREC
                   , :SWCD7201-GOBS
                   , :SWCD7201-CUSERID
                   , :SWCD7201-HTIMEST
                FROM SWVT7201
               WHERE MRNOPR  =  :SWCD7201-MRNOPR
                 AND MRNORD  =  :SWCD7201-MRNORD
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWVT7201
             TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-OK
                 IF VIAL0001-CRIACAO
AG    *             MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
|     *               TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
|     *             MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
|     *               TO SWCV5561-MRNOPR-S
|     *             MOVE SWCK0001-NOPR-EXISTS
|     *               TO SWCV5561-MRNOPR-MSG
|     *             MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
|     *               TO SWCV5561-MRNOPR-CAPLIC
AG                  CONTINUE
                 ELSE
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRNOPR
                      TO SWCV5561-MRNOPR
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRNORD
                      TO SWCV5561-MRNORD
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRBALC
                      TO SWCV5561-MRBALC
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRCCB
                      TO SWCV5561-MRCCB
                    STRING SWCD7201-NCCCCBAN  DELIMITED BY SIZE
                           SWCD7201-NCCCCSPAI DELIMITED BY SIZE
                      INTO SWCV5561-CSEND
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRTDOC
                      TO SWCV5561-MRTDOC
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRCOPE
                      TO SWCV5561-MRCOPE
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRNDOC
                      TO SWCV5561-MRNDOC
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRVLR
                      TO SWCV5561-MRVLR
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRSALD
                      TO SWCV5561-MRSALD
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRUSER
                      TO SWCV5561-MRUSER
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRDTSIS
                      TO AQCW0005-DT98
                    PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
                       THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT
                    MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10
                      TO SWCV5561-MRDTSIS
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRHORA   TO WS-MRHORA-N
                    MOVE ALL ':'           TO WS-MRHORA-X
                    MOVE WS-HRS            TO WS-HR
                    MOVE WS-MNS            TO WS-MN
                    MOVE WS-SGS            TO WS-SG
                    MOVE WS-MRHORA-X       TO SWCV5561-MRHORA
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRDRCX
                      TO SWCV5561-MRDRCX
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRETRB
                      TO SWCV5561-MRETRB
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRBALM
                      TO SWCV5561-MRBALM
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MROBS
                      TO SWCV5561-MROBS
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRNOPS
                      TO SWCV5561-MRNOPS
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MREANL
                      TO SWCV5561-MREANL
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRDTCB
                      TO AQCW0005-DT98
                    PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
                       THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT
                    MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10
                      TO SWCV5561-MRDTCB
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MREXCT
                      TO SWCV5561-MREXCT
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRMOED
                      TO SWCV5561-MRMOED
                    MOVE SWCD7201-MRDMOV
                      TO SWCV5561-MRDMOV
                    MOVE SWCD7201-GBMRINFC
                      TO SWCV5561-GBMRINFC
                    MOVE SWCD7201-IRECONC
                      TO SWCV5561-IRECONC
                    IF VIAL0001-VISUALIZACAO
                       MOVE SWCD7201-CCODMSG
                                           TO SWCV5561-CCODMSGX
                       MOVE SWCD7201-DATVAL
                                           TO AQCW0005-DT98
                       PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
                          THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT
                       MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10 TO SWCV5561-DATVALX
                       MOVE SWCD7201-COSN  TO SWCV5561-COSNX
                       MOVE SWCD7201-COSNC TO SWCV5561-COSNCX
                       MOVE SWCD7201-CREF  TO SWCV5561-CREFX
                       MOVE SWCD7201-CREFOPR
                                           TO SWCV5561-CREFOPRX
                       MOVE SWCD7201-CTIPREC
                                           TO SWCV5561-CTIPREC
                    ELSE
                       MOVE SWCV5560-CCODMSG
                                           TO SWCV5561-CCODMSGX
                       MOVE SWCV5560-DATVAL
                                           TO SWCV5561-DATVALX
                       MOVE SWCV5560-COSN  TO SWCV5561-COSNX
                       MOVE SWCV5560-COSNC TO SWCV5561-COSNCX
                       MOVE SWCV5560-CREF  TO SWCV5561-CREFX
                       MOVE SWCV5560-CREFOPR
                                           TO SWCV5561-CREFOPRX
                       MOVE SWCK0002-CTIPREC-M
                                           TO SWCV5561-CTIPREC
AG    *                IF SWCD7201-IRECONC = SWCK0002-SIM
|     *                   MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
|     *                     TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
|     *                   MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
|     *                     TO SWCV5561-MRNOPR-S
|     *                   MOVE SWCK0001-NOPR-A-EXISTS
|     *                     TO SWCV5561-MRNOPR-MSG
|     *                   MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
|     *                     TO SWCV5561-MRNOPR-CAPLIC
AG    *                END-IF
                    END-IF
                    MOVE SWCD7201-GOBS
                      TO SWCV5561-GOBS
                    IF NOT VIAL0001-VISUALIZACAO
                        CONTINUE
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 IF NOT VIAL0001-CRIACAO
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5561-MRNOPR-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-NOPR-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5561-MRNOPR-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5561-MRNOPR-CAPLIC
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           END-IF.


       2199-OBTEM-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.



      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5561-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV5561-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5561-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY AQCP0005.
